title: "pallet-bounties: fix `reclaim_bounty_funds` benchmark"
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The `reclaim_bounty_funds` benchmark panicked on runtimes with `TransferAllAssets = ()`.
      Nothing is transferred there, so `BountyFundsReclaimed` is never emitted, but the
      benchmark asserted it unconditionally. It now only asserts the event if the bounty
      account was emptied.

crates:
  - name: pallet-bounties
    bump: patch
